<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">ZYA- Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">ZYAK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan a Zyak</para>
  <para style="toc2">ZYAK</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zyak</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan a Zyak we anà un'lwaaŋ a nswɛɛŋ mwɛy bàpɛ « akà iköŋ a baan a Nzam bàpää u mɛɛn. » Zyak kan'sɔn akà aklistɔ ntɔn muswaŋ nkääl a ube aba ba a ba anà baar mpa abà Ayudà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itiir a ndaa abyà uboo byimwɛy ungö a imwɛy ukɔɔn alab un'lwaaŋ aŋàbwaŋ. Zyak wàmutɛn utàtwɛb ndaa iler an'yeerà: ma màfàfà akà Nzam anà ma bàfàlɔm akà nde unsà làkwikilà lanswà. Unsà ya yanswà, an'lwɛŋ amà mà ntɔn làmbwà anà un'naaŋ, nsii anà ndɛb, an'lɔɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ mà Nzam u mbwo isal. Un'söön a un'kaan awà wàmutɛn unsà muküünà ntɔn un'kɔl aŋàyɔŋ awà uboo a Ikööŋ. Ungö, nde wàmuswaŋ isin a ndaa akyà ban'kwo baar muyöb unsà un'kaan ande awà asànaa: un'tüüb awà uboo a làkwikilà anà isal. Uboo a itiir a ndaa a ifà ifà, nde wàmuswaŋ ube ufàkyer làlem. Ungö, nde wàmuswaŋ an'yeerà a ndandaa uboo a isin a ndaa. Nde wà munyääŋà unsà muküünà baar bàfàtwaal an'sye, anà bàfàkyey uyɔl ntɔn mutsüül atɔŋ aba nsaŋ, anà nde wàmutɛn unsà muküünà ntɔn aŋun'naaŋ, ntɔn an'kyeey bàfàmɛɛy ba baar a isal aba. Mumay, nde wàmuswaŋ nkääŋ a mpem, ngyamàkà, muküünà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndɔ̈ɔ̈m kan'sà un'kaan awà akà aklistɔ yuleŋ: kà mukyey Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Yɛsu anki, wɛɛ làkwikilà làmɛnà mbwo asin. Ntɔn, « làkwikilà làkɔ̈ɔ̈n isal làŋàkwà. »</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Mɛ Zyak, un'syääl a Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ, an'pà mbɔr akà in'sɛŋ myàkwem aŋiyweel myàpää u mɛɛn manswà.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpay anà làkyän</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, làwɛl unsà mpem aŋàbwaŋ nsii yanswà ifàlayeel, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>ntɔn bɛ làkyàyöb, isàkal naa làkwikilà abɛ làngwal kusà a nsii, nsii ayi ifàlabuul bàŋàtsim mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Wɛɛ, wɛy naa muküünà abɛ usyäl ubwaŋàbwaŋ, ntɔn bɛ làkäl bàŋàmaay anà bàŋàkwo, ukɔɔn too.<verse eid="JAS 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Isàkal naa umwɛy uboo a bɛ an'yeerà matɛy, wɛy nde ulɔ̈m ma akà Nzam awà afàpà akà baar banswà u mpem aŋàbwaŋ ukɔɔn an'pɛl. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Wɛɛ, wɛy nde ulɔ̈m anà làkwikilà, ukɔɔn asà nkyɛɛr. Ntɔn mbuur afàsà nkyɛɛr wà asànaa ibɔ a an'dà a ngyäl ufàsɛn un'pöb. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Mbuur a tub awà twon kan'si naa nde asàwal undiir akà Mwol, <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>ntɔn nde wà bölà a bölà anà we amà an'kyän mɔ̈ɔ̈l unsà ndaa ande yanswà.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Wɛy un'tɔŋ awà ŋàlàmbwà umɛn un'sak umpal kun'sɛɛn Nzam, <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>anà ŋun'naaŋ umɛn un'sak umpal kun'tyeey Nzam, ntɔn nde asàlyaaŋ asànaa iful a an'ywaŋ. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Ntɔn taaŋ lan'yàsɛnà anà ipar a mbaa a mwäänà ande, kyan'kuuŋ kite, iful akya kyan'bwà, anà ubwaŋ a kya ban'wà. Mbwo mwɛy sye usàkal ŋun'naaŋ unsà isal ande.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Un'sak akà mbuur afànwaan unsà nsii, ntɔn, isàkal naa nde kan'böŋ, nde asàwal mpà a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ayà bàbön mupà akà baar Bàfun'kwen.<verse eid="JAS 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzam anà nsii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Mbuur twon kan'tɛn, isàkal naa nde kan'bwà unsà ndɛb, naa: « Ndɛb amɛ yi yan'fà akà Nzam ». Ntɔn Nzam ukwe anki naa ube bun'lwɛb, anà nde ŋakwo ufàlwab anki mbuur. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Mbuur mbuur afàbwà u ndɛb a ngyööm a mpem ande ŋakwo, waa ya yun'syen anà yun'bwiy. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Ngyööm a mpem isàpfɛy, ya ifàbɔr man'be. Man'be màsàyɛl, ma màfàbɔr ukwà.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Atɔŋ amɛ bànkwen, twon lan'bwà ndwaŋ: <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>kab a ntal lanswà anà kab aŋàkwo lanswà màfàfà du, akà Taa a pɛɛlà. Amu nde nsɔɔmà yatɛy, itàkal naa taaŋ lan'nwaan anà nsöŋ. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Nde ŋakwo kàkwen mukipà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a ndaa ande yàndandaa, ntɔn bi ikäl bàtàtwɛb unsà ikyeer ande byanswà.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngweem anà nsyääl a Ndaa a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Atɔŋ amɛ bànkwen, bɛ làkyàyɔb naa bɛ làbà aŋun'yɛnà. Wɛy naa akà mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal anà ulɛy muwem, wɛɛ nde ukäl anà ulɛy mutɛn anà muwem nkyɛl, <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>ntɔn nkyɛl a mbuur ifàkyer anki balàbal a Nzam. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Kyakin, làpiy làbiin lanswà anà un'fur a nkyɛl, làwɛl unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n lanswà ndaa a Nzam bàkön u mpem abɛ, ntɔn ya yan'kwo mukàlatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Wɛɛ làsyääl ndaa, kà nà muwem ya mpɛl anki, naa tɛy bɛ làbàmukur bɛ ŋakwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Kyakin, isàkal naa mbuur kan'wem ndaa a Nzam, wɛɛ nde ya usyääl anki, nde wà asànaa mbuur akalerà unsà làman anà kan'man ntabwey ande asànaa awà nde. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Ungö kan'may nde muler, nde kan'kyà anà abwà adiimà naa nde kàkäl aben. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Wɛɛ mbuur afàsà mii ande ubwaŋàbwaŋ unsà Un'kɔɔn aŋàkwo, Un'kɔɔn a insaay, anà afàsyääl wa, kà nà uwem wa mpɛl anki, wɛɛ usyääl wa, mbuur awun asàkal mbuur a un'sak unsà ndaa usàkyer nde.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Isàkal naa mbuur mwɛy afàsi naa nde we anà inzaam, wɛɛ nde ufàkyekyekà anki ntɛɛn ande, nde afàkur mpem ande ŋakwo: inzaam ande kyà bunàbun. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Inzaam a ndandaa anà ikɔ̈ɔ̈n too u mii a Taa Nzam aki: ubay itii anà akweel adim unsà mpay aba, anà mukal unsà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn mukɔɔn abwà unsà làbiin a mɛɛn mà.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'kɔl aŋàyↄŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, bɛ baar làbye anà làkwikilà amu Mwol abi wàlàkoo, Yɛsu Klistɔ, twon lan'kal anà un'kɔl aŋayɔŋ. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Abun, bi itàsi naa mbuur mwɛy kan'yàbilà uboo a nköŋ abɛ, nde kan'bwaar mpɛr a wɔl anà ipfɛy aŋàbwaŋ, anà isàkal sye naa ŋàlàmbwà mwɛy kan'bwaar ipfɛy a mbiin kan'yàbilà, <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>isàkal naa bɛ lan'düül muwal mbuur kan'bwaar ipfɛy aŋàbwaŋ, anà lan'tɛn a nde naa: « Ngye, bwaay pà kà ikal aŋàbwaŋ ki », wɛɛ akà ŋàlàmbwà, bɛ lan'tɛn naa: « Ngye, kyen kakäl umbär kunà. » Mbalà yumwɛy naa: « Kyen kaswen kunà kà ikal in'fàsà mɛ in'kɔl. » <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Nkye abun bɛ kà un'kɔl aŋàyↄŋ lan'kyer anki? Nkye bɛ kà làbà ambak a kɔɔrà anki?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Atɔŋ amɛ bànkwen, làwem: nkye aŋàlàmbwà kà Nzam kasɔ̈ɔ̈l anki u mii a baar ntɔn mukabuul aŋin'naaŋ unsà làkwikilà anà muwal kwal a Imwol akyà kàpɛ nde ilää mupà akà baar bàfun'kwen? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làduum làkoo a aŋàlàmbwà. Nkye kà ŋin'naaŋ anki bàfàlapà mpay? Nkye kà ba anki sye bàfàlasyen u làbay a nsaŋ? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Nkye kà ba anki bàfàbɛy ikↄb a ntwɛn bàfàbel udu a bɛ?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Inye, isàkal naa bɛ làfàlab kiin a Un'kɔɔn, asànaa itɛɛnà Ndaa Aŋàsɔn naa: « Ngye asàkwen mbääb angye asànaa ngye ŋakwo », bɛ làfàkyer ubwaŋ. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa bɛ làfàkyer un'kɔl aŋàyↄŋ, bɛ làfàkyer man'be, anà Un'kɔɔn afàlatsüül mbar ntɔn bɛ làfàbɛy wa. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa mbuur mwɛy afàlab Un'kɔɔn wanswà, wɛɛ nde afàbɛy ikal imwɛy, apan nde afàbɛy wa wanswà. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Ntɔn, Nzam kàtɛn naa: « Twon an'tà inswem », nde sye kàtɛn naa: « Twon an'dwa ». Isàkal naa ngye atɛ anki inswem, wɛɛ ngye an'dwa mbuur, yöb naa ngye an'bɛy Un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Làtɛn anà làkyer asànaa baar bàfatsüül nsaŋ aba u mbwo a un'kɔɔn afàpà insaay. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ntɔn, Nzam usàwem anki ngyɛb mpal usàtsul nde nsaŋ a mbuur mpa afàwem baar bumwɛy ngyɛb. Wɛɛ ngyɛb ifàwal iböŋ u ntsüül a nsaŋ.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà anà isal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, ndöŋ nà mbuur mutɛn naa: « Mɛ in'we anà làkwikilà », isàkal naa nde isal byatɛy? Nkye làkwikilà alà lan'kwo lun'tsü mɔ̈ɔ̈? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Bi itàwal naa un'tɔŋ mwɛy wàbaal itàkal wun'kaar, kà we anà undiir a bwaar itàkal wàdyà anki ilä byanswà, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>wɛɛ umwɛy uboo a bɛ utɛn a nde naa: « Kyen unsà duu, bwaar ipfɛy a mpye anà dyà ubwaŋàbwaŋ », wɛɛ nde akà undiir mwɛy kun'pɛ anki ntɔn ndür ande, apan ndöŋ nà? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Ya yà abwɛy sye ntɔn làkwikilà: isàkal naa la lan'kɔɔn isal, la là undiir aŋàkwà la ŋakwo.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Wɛɛ mbuur mwɛy asàtɛn naa: « Ngye, ngye awe anà làkwikilà, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'we anà isal! Nswɛŋ làkwikilà angye làkɔ̈ɔ̈n isal! Wɛɛ akà mɛ, mɛ in'sàswaŋ làkwikilà amɛ u mbwo a isal amɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Nkye ngye afàsà làkwikilà naa Nzam wà mwɛy? Yà ubwaŋ. In'sɔŋà sye myàfàsà làkwikilà anà myàkyer afàtɛɛr! » <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Insil a mbuur, nkye ngye akwen muyöb naa làkwikilà làkɔ̈ɔ̈n isal ndöŋ latɛy? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Nkye taaràbi Abàlam bun'twey anki wàbalàbal u mbwo a isal ande, mpal kàkäb nde mwan ande Isak udu a mɛsà a ibɔɔn? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Ngye an'man naa làkwikilà anà isal ande byan'kyà mbwo mwɛy: ntɔn isal ande, làkwikilà ande lan'mɛnà làŋàkwo. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Abà, ndaa bàsön yi unsà Ndaa Aŋàsɔn yàkyer akwo: « Abàlam kàsi làkwikilà akà Nzam, waa Nzam kun'twey wàbalàbal. » Anà bun'beelà un'sam a Nzam. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Bɛ lan'man naa mbuur an'kwo bun'twey wàbalàbal ntɔn isal, kà nà ntɔn làkwikilà mpɛl anki.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Ya yàkäl abun sye ntɔn Rayab, un'kaar a pasàsɛ. Nkye kà ntɔn isal ande anki waa nde kàtoo wàbalàbal, ntɔn kàwɛl nde akyeey a Isàlɛl anà katwey nde mbwo asin? <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Asànaa ndür ikɔ̈ɔ̈n un'swey yàŋàkwà, abun sye, làkwikilà làkɔ̈ɔ̈n isal làŋàkwà.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Làlem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, twon lan'kal bàmbɔɔn mulɔŋ. Bɛ làkyàyöb naa nsaŋ abi alɔɔŋ isàkal yà ngwal. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Ntɔn bi banswà ifàtà an'pfürà. Isàkal naa mbuur mwɛy ufàtà anki pfürà unsà ntɛɛn ande, nde wà mbuur mwɛy wàŋàkwo anà wàŋàtsim muyaal ndür ande yanswà. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Isàkal naa bi kan'bäm un'siŋ u mun a mpoonà ntɔn ya iläb ukwen a bi, bi kan'kwo sye iyaal ndür aya yanswà. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Làler sye an'swà: itàkal naa ma mà uteer mbɔɔn, anà in'pöb a ngwal myàsiinà ma, kà indiir imwɛy kyan'swà bàfàbel naa kuvɛrnay laa isyen kya ma mper ukwen kaptɛn. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Ifà imwɛy sye, làlem là kitiir a ndür imwɛy. Wɛɛ la lye anà uyɔl mutɛn ndaa akölàköl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Làsii làmwɛy asànaa kimbaa ifàkuuŋ kya ndwaŋ a kölàköl! <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Làlem sye là mbaa. La là kiin a ube banswà. La là uboo a itiir a ndür abi anà làfàsà làbiin u ndür yanswà, làfàkuuŋ mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi wanswà. La ŋakwo sye làŋàkuŋà a mbaa a nsye a mbaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Mbuur kan'kwo mukwaam ntsür a umpɔr, itàkal nɛn, itàkal ntäy, itàkal nsö. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mukwaam làlem! La là bölà a bölà, là undiir mwɛy wà ube anà làŋàyɔl a idyà ifàtwaal ukwà. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>U mbwo a la, bi ifàsaak Mwol anà Taa. Anà u mbwo a la sye, bi ifàküül baar abà kàkyer Nzam kà ifà ande. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Nsaak anà un'küül yàfàtoo mun nsil nà wa. Atɔŋ amɛ, ya ikwo anki mukal abà! <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Nkye ntwà a an'dà ifàtwey an'dà a ntsà anà màbuul mun nsil nà wa? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, nkye un'te a fige afàbɔr mbɛŋ a ɔlivɛ, itàkal un'te a vin nkye afàbɔr mbɛŋ a fige? Ifuunà a an'dà a muŋ ikwo anki sye itwey an'dà a ntsà.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'yeerà màfàfà du</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Nà awe an'yeerà anà un'yɛnà uboo a bɛ? Wɛy naa nde uswɛŋ ma unsà nkääl anà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà an'yeerà ande. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa bɛ, bɛ làbà anà mpem aŋàyɔl a un'köl a buul anà dweelà a an'sye, twon lan'swaŋ ngaal, twon lan'pà ndandaa mpay u mbwo a loor abɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>An'yeerà amà kà man'fà du anki, ma mà màmɛɛn, mà ntsür, min'sɔŋà. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Ntɔn ikal akyà un'köl anà an'sye, an'pfürà anà ube bà ifà ifà byà paa sye. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Wɛɛ an'yeerà a du màŋàtàpɔŋà, ungö mà duu, mà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, mà un'tüüb, màŋàyɔl a ngyɛb anà mbɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ, mpa amye anà un'kɔl aŋàyↄŋ anà mpem yweel. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Imbɛŋ a balàbal kyàŋàkɔn unsà duu akà baar bàfàkyer ndaa a duu.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Làsin apà Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Nkir anà ngwiy uboo abɛ yan'fà ken? Nkye kà ntɔn ilään byàfànwaan uboo a ndür abɛ anki? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Bɛ làfàyɔm mpem anà bɛ làfàwal anki undiir. Bɛ làbà adwää anà aŋun'köl, anà bɛ làkwe anki muwal iböŋ. Bɛ làfànwaan anà làfàtwal an'sye. Bɛ undiir watɛy, ntɔn bɛ làfàlɔm anki. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Kya bɛ làsàlɔm, bɛ làfàwal anki undiir, ntɔn ndɔ̈ɔ̈m abɛ yà ube: ntɔn indiir làfàlɔm bɛ, bɛ bya làfàsyääl ntɔn ilään abɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Bɛ aŋinswem! Nkye bɛ làyöb anki naa ukwen a indiir a mɛɛn bà un'yiiŋ a Nzam? Abun, mbuur usàkwen mukal un'sam a mɛɛn, nde kan'bulà un'yiiŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Nkye bɛ làsii naa abunàbun waa Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛɛnà naa: « Nzam akwen unsà un'köl Dweelà kàsi nde amu bi. » <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Wɛɛ Nzam afipà kab a ngway làŋàsöön, ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛn naa: « Nzam afàmbäär aŋun'yɔl, wɛɛ nde afàswaŋ ubwaŋ ande akà aŋàlàbɔ̈ɔ̈n. » <verse eid="JAS 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Abun, làpɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ akà Nzam, wɛɛ làmbäär ileŋ, waa kya isàtiin ukwɛl apà bɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Làsin tsütsü apà Nzam, waa nde usàsin tsütsü apà bɛ. Bɛ baar a man'be, làywɛy an'kɔɔ abɛ, anà làpöŋ mpem abɛ, baar a mpem yweel! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Làyweer mpay abɛ, làsi un'saabà anà làlel. Wɛy naa an'sɛ abɛ màbulà ilel anà un'sak abɛ ubulà ngyɛb! <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Làkäl anà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n kusà a Mwol waa nde usàlasɛɛn.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Twon an'tsül un'tɔŋ nsaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Atɔŋ, twon lan'twe bɛ a bɛ. Mbuur afàtwe un'tɔŋ ande, itàkal naa afàtsul nsaŋ ande, nde wàmusaal Un'kɔɔn anà mutsüül wa mbar. Kyekà isàkal naa ngye an'tsüül Un'kɔɔn mbar, ngye afàkal anki un'syääl a wa, wɛɛ ngye awà ntɛɛn. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Mbuur mwɛy mpɛl afàpà un'kɔɔn anà nde mpɛl sye awà ntɛɛn. Nde mpɛl kan'kwo mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà mudwa wa. Ngye, ngye awà nà mutsüül mbääb angye mbar?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làtön uyɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Abun, bɛ baar làfàtɛn naa: « Ŋàbà, itàkal naa nkàswà, bi iyàkyà bul là. Bi kwo ikàkyer mbul mwɛy, bi isàkàtà an'yà, anà bi isàkàwal ngim. » <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làyöb anki akà ikikye naa nkàswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ asàkal aben, ntɔn bɛ làbà asànaa un'swey kan'mɛnà, ungö a kitaaŋ kan'fàyaalà. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Le, bɛ làlàtɛn naa: « Isàkal naa Mwol kan'kwen, bi isàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà bi isàkyer abà itàkal abunà. » <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Wɛɛ apanà bɛ làbàmuswaŋ ngaal unsà uyɔl abɛ. Uyɔl atubàbà bube. <verse eid="JAS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Abun, isàkal naa mbuur mwɛy akyàyöb mukyer ubwaŋ, wɛɛ isàkal naa nde ba ukyer anki, apan nde kan'bwà unsà man'be.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Aŋun'naaŋ, ngyɛb akà bɛ!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Abun, bɛ aŋun'naaŋ, làlel anà in'kwɛŋ, ntɔn mpay iyàyà udu a bɛ! <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Un'naaŋ abɛ wàŋàpɔɔn, ipfɛy abɛ in'swab myàkyàdyàdyà. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Wɔl abɛ anà ngim abɛ yàŋàbwà an'tär, an'tär ama màsàlatɛɛl imbäl ibe, ma màsàdyà in'twaŋ abɛ asànaa mbaa. Bɛ làkyàköŋà in'naaŋ u ntsüü a taaŋ! <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Le, bɛ làkyàtɔn mufur baar bàfàsal uboo a an'ywaŋ abɛ. Làfur aba alà làmusà in'kwɛŋ, anà Nzam, Mwol aŋità, akyàwem in'tär a abweel abà. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ u mɛɛn kan'kal aŋàyɔl a indiir a ntwɛn anà un'sak. Ndür abɛ làkyàbuul may may asànaa ntsür adilà ilä mukyɛl un'kwaal. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Bɛ làpɛ ntaaŋàmbar anà làdwä mbuur a balàbal. Nde in'peen kàlasi anki.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkääŋ a mpem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Abun, atɔŋ, làkäl anà nkääŋ a mpem tii u ngyeel a Mwol. Làler un'lem a an'ywaŋ: nde afàdil imbɛŋ a mfun ifàtoo u mɛɛn ukɔɔn ayɔn tii mpal usàwal nde mbɛŋ atàtwɛb anà yàngöngö. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Bɛ sye, làkäl anà nkääŋ a mpem. Làkäl anà mpem aŋàtsim ntɔn ngyeel a Mwol yà tsütsü.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Atɔŋ, twon lan'kal anà buul u mpem bɛ a bɛ, ntɔn mutiin mukal kusà a làbay a nsaŋ. Le, ntɛɛn wà u mun a mbwo! <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Atɔŋ, unsà ndaa iler mpay anà nkääŋ a mpem, mbaan alab yà yà aŋangɔɔm abà bàtɛn kà ikɔb a Mwol. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Làler: bi ifàkan aŋàmun'küünà. Bɛ làkyàwem làsaŋ a nkääŋ a mpem a Yɔb anà bɛ làkyàyöb ndaa kun'kyer Mwol, ntɔn Mwol wàŋàyɔl a mpem a ukwen anà ngyɛb.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Wɛɛ unsà ya yanswà, atɔŋ amɛ, twon lan'dyà kyän itàkal u du, itàkal u mɛɛn, itàkal kà aben. Wɛy naa: « Inye » abɛ làkäl inye anà « Aay » abɛ làkäl aay, ntɔn bɛ làkɔɔn akwɛlà u mbar a Nzam.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà ntɔn abɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Nkye umwɛy uboo a bɛ wà unsà mpay? Wɛy nde uyamà. Nkye nde wà unsà un'sak? Wɛy nde utɔ̈l an'diim. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Nkye wà anà mbuur uboo a bɛ awe anà ukyal? Wɛy nde ubel andweer a Ikööŋ, ntɔn ba bun'si u ngyamàkà, waa ungö bun'tsuul may udu a un'tswe ande kà ikↄb a Mwol. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Ngyamàkà a làkwikilà isàkɔɔr un'bɛy, Mwol akyer asumbaar. Isàkal naa nde we anà man'be, bàkyerà asun'dwääl ma. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Làkyey man'be abɛ bɛ a bɛ anà làyamà bɛ a bɛ, ntɔn bɛ làkɔɔrà. Ngyamàkà a mbuur a balàbal ifàsal ngwal mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Ɛli kàkäl mbuur asànaa bi, nde kàyamà unsà muküünà naa mbul ukɔ̈ɔ̈n anɔ, wa sye kànɔ̈ anki u mɛɛn isii a mbul tär a ngɔn syaam. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Ungö, kàfàyamà nde, mbul kàkyer anɔ, mɛɛn màtwey imbɛŋ ama.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Atɔŋ amɛ, isàkal naa umwɛy uboo a bɛ wàŋàbwà ndwaŋ, ukwɛl anà ndandaa, wɛɛ mbuur asin kàmun'fuur, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>làyöb naa ufuur mbuur a man'be u mbwo kàwɛy nde, yà mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande kà ukwà, anà mubiiŋ un'kàbɔ a man'be.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
